{"id":"zuku_nftig","lemma":"zukünftig","pos":"adj","rank":4286,"glosses":["future","prospective"],"ipa":"/ˈt͡suːˌkʏnftɪç/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/f/f6/De-zuk%C3%BCnftig.ogg/De-zuk%C3%BCnftig.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Was möchtest du zukünftig sein?","en":"What do you want to be in the future?","words":[{"g":"what"},{"g":"to like","l":"mögen"},{"g":"you"},null,{"g":"to be"}]},{"text":"Zukünftig werde ich stärker lernen.","en":"I'll study harder in the future.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/745206","words":[null,{"g":"to become","l":"werden"},{"g":"I"},{"g":"strong","l":"stark"},{"g":"to learn"}]},{"text":"Ich werde mich zukünftig um meine Eltern kümmern.","en":"I will look after my parents in the future.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to become","l":"werden"},{"g":"me","l":"ich"},null,{"g":"around / at"},{"g":"my","l":"mein"},{"g":"parents"},{"g":"to take care"}]},{"text":"Was möchtest du zukünftig machen?","en":"What do you want to do in the future?","words":[{"g":"what"},{"g":"to like","l":"mögen"},{"g":"you"},null,{"g":"to make"}]},{"text":"Ich gehe davon aus, dass es hier zukünftig einen U-Bahnhof geben wird.","en":"I expect a subway station will be here in the future.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to go, to walk","l":"gehen"},{"g":"from it"},{"g":"out of / from"},{"g":"that"},{"g":"it"},{"g":"here"},null,{"g":"a","l":"ein"},{"g":"U"},{"g":"railway depot"},{"g":"to give"},{"g":"to become","l":"werden"}]}]}